            <ui:InvokeCode ContinueOnError="{x:Null}" Code="' The statement side never created these, so every row(&quot;Aging&quot;) write below was&#xA;' throwing into a swallowing Try/Catch and the columns came out blank.&#xA;Try&#xA;    dtSwiftOutstanding.Columns.Add(&quot;Aging&quot;)&#xA;Catch ex As Exception&#xA;End Try&#xA;Try&#xA;    dtSwiftOutstanding.Columns.Add(&quot;Aging Group&quot;)&#xA;Catch ex As Exception&#xA;End Try&#xA;Try&#xA;    dtSwiftOutstanding.Columns.Add(&quot;BOT Classification&quot;)&#xA;Catch ex As Exception&#xA;End Try&#xA;dtSwiftOutstanding.AsEnumerable().ToList().ForEach(Sub(row)&#xA;    If Not String.IsNullOrEmpty(row(&quot;Debit&quot;).ToString()) Then&#xA;        row(&quot;Debit&quot;) = Double.Parse(row(&quot;Debit&quot;).ToString())&#xA;    End If&#xA;    If Not String.IsNullOrEmpty(row(&quot;Credit&quot;).ToString()) Then&#xA;        row(&quot;Credit&quot;) = Double.Parse(row(&quot;Credit&quot;).ToString())&#xA;    End If&#xA;End Sub)&#xA;" DisplayName="Invoke Code" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="478.4,196.8" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="InvokeCode_3">
